#. module: crm_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:crm_compassion.event_letter_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"invoice_lines\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"donations\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.get_donations()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"ambassadors\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.mapped(&#x27;user_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"0\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"currency\" t-value=\"invoice_lines[0].move_id.currency_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    On behalf of Compassion Switzerland we truly thank you for your <t t-out=\"&#x27;generous&#x27; if object.config_id.id != 52 else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> gift of <br/><t t-out=\"donations[0]\"></t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"donations[1]\">\n"
"                        <!-- space --> supporting\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"ambassadors\">\n"
"                            <!-- space --> <t t-out=\"ambassadors.get_list(&#x27;full_name&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                            <!-- space --> for the <t t-out=\"donations[1]\"></t>.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"ambassadors.filtered(&#x27;advocate_details_id.quote&#x27;)\" t-as=\"amb\">\n"
"                       <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"/>\n"
"<div id=\"ambassador_quote\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"amb.advocate_details_id.thank_you_quote\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"                         <t t-if=\"len(ambassadors) != 1 and len(ambassadors) != count\">\n"
"                                  <br/>\n"
"                                  <br/>\n"
"                                  <br/>\n"
"                           </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(ambassadors) == 2\">\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.event_id.thank_you_text\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.event_id.thank_you_text\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"partner.number_sponsorships\">\n"
"                        Have you recently written to your sponsor child? Our website allows you to write a letter directly online. Why not have another go at writing this week?\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"partner.is_new_donor\">\n"
"                            Since 1952, Compassion has been pursuing a very specific mission: to release as many children as possible from extreme poverty – in Jesus’ name.\n"
"In collaboration with 8600 local churches, we currently support 2,3 million children in 27 countries of the global south.\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not partner.opt_out\">\n"
"                            Is the future of the world's poorest children important to you? Compassion offers different ways and solutions to release children from poverty. At the heart of Compassion’s ministry is the Child Sponsorship program. Maybe you would consider sponsoring a child and offering support and encouragement throughout their development? You can find further information on\n"
"www.compassion.ch or you can call us on 0800 874 773.\n"
"                                 <br/>\n"
"                                 <br/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    We just want to take this opportunity to thank you once again for your generosity and support towards these children in need.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Sincerely yours\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Rachel Maglo\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Donors relation\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(ambassadors) != 0 and len(ambassadors) != 1\">\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"invoice_lines\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"donations\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.get_donations()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ambassadors\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.mapped(&#x27;user_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"0\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"currency\" t-value=\"invoice_lines[0].move_id.currency_id.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout cœur pour votre <t t-out=\"&#x27;généreux&#x27; if object.config_id.id != 52 else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> don de <t t-out=\"donations[0]\"></t>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"donations[1]\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"ambassadors\">\n"
"            pour <t t-out=\"ambassadors.get_list(&#x27;full_name&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        (<t t-out=\"donations[1]\"></t>).\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    .\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-foreach=\"ambassadors.filtered(&#x27;advocate_details_id.quote&#x27;)\" t-as=\"amb\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"/>\n"
"    <div id=\"ambassador_quote\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"amb.advocate_details_id.thank_you_quote\"></t>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        Grâce à votre engagement et à celui de <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Eglises partenaires dans <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> pays du Sud, nous pouvons soutenir <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> millions enfants à l'heure actuelle. Avec un objectif commun: libérer le plus d'enfants possible durablement de la pauvreté.\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"partner.number_sponsorships &lt; 1\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Souhaitez-vous parrainer un enfant? En ce moment, Compassion recherche urgemment un parrain ou une marraine pour les enfants suivants: www.compassion.ch/parrainer.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"partner.is_new_donor\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Pour toute question relative à votre don, n'hésitez pas à prendre contact avec nous. Encore une fois, merci de nous aider à changer le monde, un enfant à la fois.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Avec nos meilleures salutations et à bientôt!\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

